+Printer commands use the long request budget and release the listener's initial write deadline while waiting. The generated client also keeps the request open. Homing, bed probing and filament heating can take longer than the ordinary thirty-second API budget. The driver still bounds each action and reports an unknown outcome if its deadline or connection ends before the printer answers. An unknown outcome is never retried automatically.
